# MQTT Password file for Active Target System
#
# This file can be used to store usernames and passwords for MQTT authentication
# Currently, authentication is disabled for simplicity, but this file can be
# populated and enabled in mosquitto.conf if needed
#
# To create password entries, use:
# mosquitto_passwd -c passwd username
#
# Example entries (commented out):
# admin:$6$password_hash_here
# device:$6$password_hash_here
